# Python

- Target 3.12; use `from __future__ import annotations` in app modules.
- Prefer stdlib; pinned deps in `requirements.txt` only.
- FastAPI routes stay thin; business logic in `app/pricing.py` and `app/parsers.py`.
- SQLite via `app/store.py`; no ORM.
- Run `pytest -q` after non-trivial changes to pricing or parsers.